      "content": "I can't advise you to take any medication without consulting your doctor. However, I can tell you that serotonin syndrome can be a serious condition, ranging from mild symptoms like agitation and confusion to life-threatening complications like seizures, coma, and even death. If you're experiencing severe pain, consider seeking immediate attention at an emergency room or urgent care, where they can assess and manage your pain while also providing guidance on any potential medication interactions.",
