      "content": "i hear you on the er thing but i really dont want to go there if i dont have to, it's so expensive and time consuming. if i just stick to a really small amount of tramadol, like half a pill, once a day only when it really hurts, wouldn't that basically negate the danger? it feels like a lot of overkill to go to the hospital just for some back pain when i just want to take something to feel better.",
